            "review_title": "Review at Gogi House",
            "review_text": "EndaTravel\nSilver Spring, Maryland365 contributions\n0\nGood, Quick Service Korean Food\nOct 2016\nGogi House may be a chain, but the flavors taste authentic. We ordered the beef with sesame oil (approximately 249K VND) and the beef with Gogi sauce. We received kimchi soup, kimchi, pickled asian cucumber and seaweed with it. We also ordered pajeon and rice. The meat is cooked right in front of you by the waiter who ensures that it is cooked to the proper temperature. \n\nThe pajeon was really good along with the kimchi soup and kimchi. The meat was a bit too tough, but it was seasoned well. \n\nOverall, a decent meal in a modern restaurant. Loved the ambiance - hipster, if you will. If you need a break from Vietnamese food, this restaurant is the way to go.\nRead more\nWritten October 17, 2016",
